*3D Mechanical Design, Assembly and Drafting – SolidWorks*

This project showcases a collection of 3D mechanical models and assemblies developed using SolidWorks, including Pipe Vice Assembly, Butterfly Valve Assembly, and Screw Jack Assembly. 
Each design demonstrates practical knowledge of 3D part modeling, assembly design, component integration, and mechanical engineering principles.

The project focuses on creating accurate 3D models with proper dimensions, proportions, and component relationships. 
It also includes detailed **2D drafting and engineering drawing sheets** prepared using SolidWorks, featuring orthographic views, sectional views, dimensions, 
and technical details of the designed components and assemblies.

Through these projects, I gained practical experience in 3D modeling, assembly operations, 2D drafting, technical documentation, and engineering design visualization.

### Project Details
- Software Used:** SolidWorks
- Project Type:** 3D Modeling, Assembly Design and 2D Drafting
- Assemblies:** Pipe Vice, Butterfly Valve, Screw Jack
- Additional Content:** SolidWorks Engineering Drawing Sheets
- Domain:** Mechanical Engineering – Design and Development
- Key Skills:** 3D Part Modeling, Assembly Design, 2D Drafting, Orthographic Projection, Sectional Views, Dimensioning, and Engineering Visualization
